              "ImageDescription": {
                "value": "For taking this photo and licensing it under a free licence a (press) accreditation was required. The photographer had a valid accreditation and has sent it to the <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/Commons:Volunteer_Response_Team\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Commons:Volunteer Response Team\">email response team</a>, it has been archived in the VRTS system. Users with VRTS account can access it <span class=\"plainlinksneverexpand\"><b><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ticket.wikimedia.org/otrs/index.pl?Action=AgentTicketZoom&amp;TicketNumber=2013041910011699\">here</a></b></span>.\nPlease be aware that (press) accreditations are a permission to generally take photos only and do <b>not</b> make any statement about the copyright status of this photo!",
