              },
              "Artist": {
                "value": "<div style=\"border:1px solid silver; background-color:#eaeeed;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"3px\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" colspan=\"2\">\n<p><b><i>Dieses Foto</i> ist von Teilnehmern der <i><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://melle-gymnasium.de/\">Foto AG Gymnasium Melle</a></i></b> erstellt worden.\n</p>\n<p>Achtung: Dieses Bild ist <u><b>nicht gemeinfrei.</b></u> Es ist zwar frei benutzbar, aber gesetzlich gesch\u00fctzt.</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" colspan=\"2\">\n<p><b><i>This photo</i> was created by Members of the <i><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://melle-gymnasium.de/\">Foto AG Gymnasium Melle</a></i></b>\n</p>\n<p>Note: this image is <u><b>not in the Public Domain.</b></u> It is free to use but protected by law.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:11-09-04-nikon-d300s-by-RalfR-DSC_5378.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/11-09-04-nikon-d300s-by-RalfR-DSC_5378.png/120px-11-09-04-nikon-d300s-by-RalfR-DSC_5378.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/11-09-04-nikon-d300s-by-RalfR-DSC_5378.png/250px-11-09-04-nikon-d300s-by-RalfR-DSC_5378.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3219\" data-file-height=\"3219\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"40%\">\n<p>Bitte benutzen Sie nach M\u00f6glichkeit als Bildnachweis:\n</p>\n<p><span style=\"border: 1px solid navy; padding:6px; background-color:#d9e1df\"><b>Foto AG Gymnasium Melle, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/legalcode\">CC-BY-SA 3.0</a></b></span></p>\n<p>in unmittelbarer N\u00e4he beim Bild oder an einer Stelle in ihrer Publikation, wo dies \u00fcblich ist. Dabei mu\u00df der Zusammenhang zwischen Bild und Nennung gewahrt bleiben. \n</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"40%\">\n<p>I prefer the following credit:\n</p>\n<p><span style=\"border: 1px solid navy; padding:6px; background-color:#d9e1df\"><b>Foto AG Gymnasium Melle, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/legalcode\">CC-BY-SA 3.0</a></b></span></p> near to the photo or at a location that is common in your publication. The relation between image and mention must be maintained. \n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rohloff-speedhub-500-14-by-RalfR-05.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Rohloff-speedhub-500-14-by-RalfR-05.png/120px-Rohloff-speedhub-500-14-by-RalfR-05.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"125\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Rohloff-speedhub-500-14-by-RalfR-05.png/250px-Rohloff-speedhub-500-14-by-RalfR-05.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1474\" data-file-height=\"1533\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<p>Bitte lesen Sie den <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/legalcode\">vollen Lizenztext</a> gr\u00fcndlich, bevor Sie das Bild nutzen! Wenn Sie Fragen haben, kontaktieren Sie per Mail Karsten Mosebach: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"mailto:Gymnasium-Melle@t-online.de\">Gymnasium-Melle@t-online.de</a>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<p>Please review the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/legalcode\">full license requirements</a> carefully before using this image. If you would like to clarify the terms, please contact by email Karsten Mosebach: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"mailto:Gymnasium-Melle@t-online.de\">Gymnasium-Melle@t-online.de</a>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>",
